n this project, I developed a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) model to classify images into two categories: Apples and Tomatoes.

Through this project, I explored how deep learning and computer vision can be used for image classification and how CNNs automatically learn important visual features from images.

🛠️ Technologies Used:

Python

TensorFlow / Keras

Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)

Image Processing

Deep Learning

💡 Key Learning Outcomes:

Understanding CNN architecture

Image preprocessing and data preparation

Model training and evaluation

Applying deep learning to real-world image classification tasks
